          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 73670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nauczmy się, jak dodawać i usuwać wartości za pomocą tablic. Na przykładzie takiej aplikacji listy zadań, która używa tablicy do dodawania i usuwania zadań.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;To-Do List&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        body {&#xA;            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin: 0;&#xA;            background-color: #f5f5f5;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-container {&#xA;            background-color: white;&#xA;            padding: 20px;&#xA;            border-radius: 10px;&#xA;            margin: 24px auto;&#xA;            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);&#xA;        }&#xA;        h1 {&#xA;            font-size: 24px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 20px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item {&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;] {&#xA;            width: 20px;&#xA;            height: 20px;&#xA;            margin-right: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item.completed span {&#xA;            text-decoration: line-through;&#xA;            color: #ccc;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&quot;todo-container&quot;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h1&gt;To-Dos&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-1&quot; checked&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy clear nail polish 💅&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-2&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy soap bar 🧼&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-3&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;paint soap with nail-polish&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-4&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;casually leave soap in bathroom&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-5&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;enjoy&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;script&gt;&#xA;        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {&#xA;            const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('.todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;]');&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                checkbox.addEventListener('change', function() {&#xA;                    if (this.checked) {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                    } else {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.remove('completed');&#xA;                    }&#xA;                });&#xA;            });&#xA;&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                if (checkbox.checked) {&#xA;                    checkbox.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                }&#xA;            });&#xA;        });&#xA;    &lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Push",
            "id": 73671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby dodać wartość taką jak <code>\"groceries\"</code> do tablicy, wpisz nazwę tablicy <code>toDo</code>, a następnie kropkę <code>.</code> i metodę tablicy <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>toDo</code>, następnie <code>.</code> i na końcu <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby dodać do tablicy wartość taką jak <code>\"groceries\"</code>, wpisujemy nazwę tablicy <code>toDo</code>, kropkę <code>.</code>, a następnie metodę <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>. Dodaj nowe zadanie, aby wyświetlana tablica kończyła się wartością <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop(&quot;groceries&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tasks\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push(groceries)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>toDo</code>, następnie <code>.</code> i na końcu <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "End of the array",
            "id": 73672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodanie wartości za pomocą metody <code>.push()</code> umieszcza ją na końcu tablicy.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodanie wartości za pomocą metody <code>.push()</code> umieszcza ją na końcu tablicy. Spraw, aby ostatnią wyświetlaną wartością było <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>push</code>, a następnie <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "More values",
            "id": 73673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Możesz dodać wiele wartości za pomocą <code>.push()</code>, oddzielając je przecinkiem <code>,</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;feed cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries', 'feed cat' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Za pomocą <code>.push()</code> możemy dodać wiele wartości, rozdzielając je przecinkiem <code>,</code>. Dodaj oba zadania w jednym wywołaniu, aby <code>\"feed cat\"</code> było ostatnie.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;feed cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries', 'feed cat' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Pop",
            "id": 73674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby usunąć ostatni element tablicy, wpisz nazwę tablicy <code>toDo</code>, kropkę <code>.</code> oraz metodę tablicy <code>pop()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>toDo</code>, następnie <code>.</code>, a potem <code>pop</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store removed element",
            "id": 73676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdy przypisujemy <code>toDo.pop()</code> do zmiennej, zmienna przechowuje wartość, którą usuwamy.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(chore);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>chore</code>, a następnie <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdy przypisujemy <code>toDo.pop()</code> do zmiennej, przechowuje ona usuwaną wartość. Zapisz usuniętą wartość w <code>chore</code> i wyświetl <code>dishes</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(chore);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"toDo\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>chore</code>, a następnie <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Push",
            "id": 73870,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jakiej metody używamy do dodania wartości do tablicy?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>.push()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tablica zawiera <code>\"call mom\"</code>. Które wywołanie dodaje <code>\"groceries\"</code> bez usuwania żadnej wartości?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.shift()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>.push()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the array",
            "id": 73871,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dokąd trafia nowa wartość dodana za pomocą <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Na końcu tablicy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Na początku tablicy</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Na końcu tablicy.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zaczynamy od <code>[\"call mom\", \"dishes\"]</code> i używamy <code>.push(\"groceries\")</code>. Gdzie znajdzie się <code>\"groceries\"</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Na końcu tablicy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Na początku tablicy</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Zastępuje ostatnią wartość</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Na końcu tablicy.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: More values",
            "id": 73872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ile wartości możemy dodać do tablicy za pomocą <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tak wiele, ile chcemy</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tylko jedna wartość naraz</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tak wiele, ile chcemy.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co można dodać za pomocą <code>toDo.push(\"groceries\", \"feed cat\")</code> podczas tego jednego wywołania metody?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Obie wartości</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tylko pierwszą wartość</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tylko jedną wartość, ponieważ <code>.push()</code> przyjmuje jedną wartość</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Obie wartości.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 73873,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jakiej metody używamy do usunięcia ostatniego elementu tablicy?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.push()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ostatnim elementem tablicy jest <code>\"dishes\"</code>. Która metoda usunie ten element?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.shift()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 73874,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak możemy zapisać wartość usuniętą przez <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Przechowując ją w zmiennej</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nie możemy tego zapisać, ponieważ <code>.pop()</code> nie zwraca wartości</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Przechowując ją w zmiennej.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co przechowuje zmienna <code>removed</code> po wykonaniu <code>const removed = toDo.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wartość, która była ostatnia w tablicy <code>toDo</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tablicę po usunięciu z niej ostatniej wartości</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nic, ponieważ <code>.pop()</code> nie zwraca żadnej wartości</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wartość, która była ostatnia w tablicy <code>toDo</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 73876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>\"joe\"</code> do tablicy aktywnych użytkowników.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activeUsers);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>activeUsers</code>, a następnie <code>.push(\"joe\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tablica powinna wyświetlać <code>[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]</code>. Dodaj <code>\"joe\"</code> bez usuwania żadnego aktywnego użytkownika.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activeUsers);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".push(joe)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>activeUsers</code>, a następnie <code>.push(\"joe\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: End of the array",
            "id": 73877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj <code>\"sugar\"</code> na końcu tablicy, kodując <code>.push(\"sugar\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cookies.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cookies);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'flour', 'butter', 'sugar' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>.push(\"sugar\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: More values",
            "id": 73878,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj na końcu tablicy najpierw <code>2</code>, a następnie <code>500</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" transactions = [\" /><text value=\"-100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"transactions.push(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(transactions);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ -100, 5, 2, 500 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>(</code>, następnie <code>2</code>, a potem <code>500</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Oddziel wartości przecinkiem, aby dodać kilka naraz za pomocą metody <code>.push()</code>. Dodaj najpierw <code>2</code>, a potem <code>500</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" transactions = [\" /><text value=\"-100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"transactions.push(\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(transactions);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-100\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ -100, 5, 2, 500 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>push</code>, następnie <code>(</code>, <code>2</code>, <code>500</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Pop",
            "id": 73879,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń wartość <code>true</code> z końca tablicy za pomocą kodu <code>.pop()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ordersDelivered = [\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ordersDelivered.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(ordersDelivered);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"67\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ false, false ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Store removed element",
            "id": 73880,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń i wyświetl ostatnią wartość tablicy, tworząc zmienną i ustawiając jej wartość na <code>themes.pop()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" current = themes.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(current);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dark mode\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>current</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, a potem <code>themes.pop()</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usuń i wyświetl ostatnią wartość tablicy, tworząc zmienną i przypisując do niej <code>themes.pop()</code>. Wyświetl <code>dark mode</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" themes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;classic&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dark mode&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" current = themes.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(current);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"themes\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"themes.push()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dark mode\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>current</code>, następnie <code>=</code>, <code>themes.pop()</code> i na końcu <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
